{"id":"16a587bb999452b8","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-var-in-term.md","title":"Variables in Term","display":"df-var-in-term — Variables in Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-var-in-term","aliases":["57-df-var-in-term"],"display":"df-var-in-term — Variables in Term","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-var-in-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-var-in-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-var-in-term — Variables in Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{var}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{var}(c)\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\quad\n\\mathrm{var}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{var}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{var}(c)\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\quad\n\\mathrm{var}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\quad\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\quad\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限语法树递归唯一确定该函数；大写 Var(t) 是原调用中出现的同义记号，不改变变量字母表 Var。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"