{BV}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset$。上述类型和函数见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-bound-variable]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]。满足与项解释见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]、[[57-df-term-interpretation]]；使用 [[57-df-free-for]] 和 [[57-thm-substitution-formula]]。$\\models_\\beta$ 缩写 $\\models[\\beta]$。"},{"id":"8216e0b1a4cf9570","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$、$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{FV}$、$\\mathrm{var}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]，语法见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。"},{"id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"公式及项变量函数见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]；变量和符号分量见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。"},{"id":"084b8299a8fe4c6c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$\\mathrm{HU}(S)$、$\\mathrm{var}$、$\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]、[[57-df-term]]。"},{"id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^k$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；项和项变量见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\geq1$。不假定常量非空，因而允许原定义的空 Herbrand 宇宙；需要非空结构时另行要求。"},{"id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}$。项变量函数取 [[57-df-var-in-term]]。保留原接口 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2$ “无自由一阶变量”的非标准约定；另以 $\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$ 表示两类变量都无自由出现的公式。$\\mathrm{free}$ 在二阶公式上的扩展由下式递归定义，不把一阶函数直接应用于定义域外。"},{"id":"51c16bf642c7ebc0","anchor":"ref-7